    course_description = '<p>The business world needs innovators. People who can tackle tomorrow’s challenges, today. People like you. And with the Bachelor of Business from Charles Sturt University, you get the very best start to your business career. Broad, applied knowledge. Industry-aligned majors: Finance, HR Management, Management and Leadership, Marketing, Strategic Planning. Experience with employers. It’s all here.</p>',
